  "rootTopic": {
    "id": "448e404d-574a-4ab8-8796-a17190f70ca0",
    "title": "《色，戒》人物关系图",
    "children": {
      "attached": [
        {
          "id": "ee786a50-4a29-4d5a-908d-87ae12adfcf5",
          "title": "王佳芝",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "别名：佳芝、麦太太\n学生剧团当家花旦，以商人少奶奶身份接近易氏夫妇；当前参与秘密行动。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "f1953d81-a0f5-4500-aaff-63a900fab115",
          "title": "易先生",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "别名：老易\n易太太的丈夫，从事特工工作；与佳芝秘密约会。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "92b013db-1399-45c8-8468-431b3f4b47ae",
          "title": "易太太",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "牌局主人，两年前在香港结识佳芝。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "745e7114-bc4b-429f-8a26-7e4b17c4367a",
          "title": "马太太",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "别名：黑斗篷之一\n牌局女客，穿黑斗篷。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "05a9fd0e-f0ba-48e5-8d8f-a04bbfc32fa9",
          "title": "另一位黑斗篷太太",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "马太太对面的牌友，姓名未明。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "d2d70926-20af-4b25-abca-4454de85bbbb",
          "title": "廖太太",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "被谈及的牌友，昨日做东。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "69917e75-18b7-42e3-9781-783b9296cf8d",
          "title": "小李",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "易太太所述昨日宴席上的请客者。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ec18bac4-3007-4ce0-be11-5aa940f447e6",
          "title": "小李太太",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "与小李一同出现在昨日宴席。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "2ee0fa1d-6913-4912-bd2a-85e71d6ce03a",
          "title": "品芬",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "上门提供珠宝的掮客。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ccb65226-ae8c-487a-9aac-a58a4c061ba5",
          "title": "邝裕民",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "别名：二哥\n佳芝的行动同伴；扮作麦太太表弟，与吴联络。“二哥”为通话称呼。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "cf1cc414-1c59-4670-8beb-074b3721471c",
          "title": "梁闰生",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "学生小集团成员，与佳芝发生亲密关系后关系僵化。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "064c3d97-ce13-4f12-9ac9-1598d2bb469e",
          "title": "黄磊",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "为早期行动筹款、租房、借车并充当司机，后来负债。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "98a02919-c532-40da-a6bb-d13dab050dc6",
          "title": "欧阳灵文",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "别名：麦先生、小麦\n扮演佳芝的商人丈夫；麦先生的婚姻及生意叙述属于掩护身份。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "0a97a634-0afa-4820-af01-bf0e0d6e12f0",
          "title": "赖秀金",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "小集团中除佳芝外唯一的女生。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "e22efee2-2fac-4179-b50d-fb69656ec25b",
          "title": "吴",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "别名：姓吴的\n与学生小集团接上线的地下工作者；姓氏真实性受叙述质疑。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "89a2eb0c-b154-4335-858f-e53780a15fa9",
          "title": "副官",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "邝裕民的小同乡，提供消息并引介接近易太太。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "225ca239-d1fe-4fab-b08d-3f903fcdc72c",
          "title": "易家女佣",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "向佳芝通报车已等候。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "2962c7a5-3763-43d7-9453-25cdca88badd",
          "title": "送佳芝的司机",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "从易家送佳芝到第一家咖啡馆后被打发回去。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "6dcc149c-ecdf-4764-bfc1-5d5772c7099c",
          "title": "接易先生的司机",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "替佳芝开车门，随后驾车送两人到珠宝店。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "a07664a0-6b0f-4600-a405-de5d8819454c",
          "title": "中装男子",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "咖啡馆里独自看报并注意佳芝的男子。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "8b50da0b-ef97-45cb-abad-d79e0aab219e",
          "title": "检修单车的男子",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "皮货店门口约三十岁的平头男子，身份不明。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ee4a65ff-a660-4bf2-8c8f-79bf998cdeea",
          "title": "印度店员",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "别名：那印度人\n珠宝店内接待两人并引路上楼。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "12ec11f8-ced6-4eb3-94a9-4b265cc17a34",
          "title": "汪精卫",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "回忆中易氏夫妇跟随的人物。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "50c81da3-1d8a-4f7a-9841-1d6f80ac30c8",
          "title": "汪夫人",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "回忆提及的汪精卫妻子。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "06d78554-432d-486b-8f70-059632119fe1",
          "title": "陈公博",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "回忆中随汪精卫到香港的人物。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "2d3f7e29-1dfa-4fca-8ac2-98f416f6b9ee",
          "title": "曾仲鸣",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "被叙述为已在河内遇刺。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "91bf2658-d673-4311-ab22-c5a31ad3e661",
          "title": "周佛海",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "因家中窗帘陈设被提及。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "b040e0fd-e33a-423e-a448-b092ab299127",
          "title": "巴达先生",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "贺镜题款中的开业受贺者，未确认是否在场。"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "d0f651ce-801f-4bf1-ad94-eacf21a9db5f",
          "title": "陈茂坤",
          "children": {
            "attached": []
          },
          "notes": {
            "plain": {
              "content": "贺镜题款中的赠贺者。"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
